            "pub_date": "2026-10-31 06:33:01",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美股｜美股周五受壓 納指挫2.856% 費半瀉7.201%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜美股周五受壓 納指挫2.856% 費半瀉7.201%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜美股周五受壓 納指挫2.856% 費半瀉7.201%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至10月30日周五下午5時30分，美股三大指數向下。道瓊斯30工業指數收報51770.31點，跌572.25點或1.093%。標普500指數跌1.818%，納斯達克綜合指數挫2.856%，費城半導體指數急瀉7.201%。歐洲方面，倫敦富時100指數微升0.072%，米蘭MIB指數跌1.003%，蘇黎世SMI指數升0.365%。</p></div>",
